  "0.0.0" => "Hyrule Warriors",
  "0.1.0" => "Hyrule Warriors",
  "0.2.0" => "Total Play Time: %s",
  "0.3.0" => "There is not enough space available in the
system memory. You need %s or more
in order to continue playing. Please go to the
Wii U System Settings to manage save data.",
  "0.4.0" => "You don't have any save data for
Hyrule Warriors. You need save data
in order to use the autosave feature.
Would you like to create new save data?",
  "0.5.0" => "Your current save data cannot be used.
You will need new save data before you can
start the game. Would you like to delete your
current save data and create new save data?",
  "0.6.0" => "Start the game without creating save data?",
  "0.7.0" => "The current save data belongs to another user.
You will not be able to save, autosave, or obtain
medals while playing with this save data.
Load current save data anyway?",
  "0.8.0" => "Another user's data has been loaded.
You will not be able to save, autosave,
or obtain medals while playing with this
save data.",
  "0.9.0" => "You will not be able to to use the autosave
function while playing with another user's
save data. Delete the current save data and
create new save data?",
  "0.10.0" => "You cannot overwrite this save data because
it belongs to another user.",
  "0.11.0" => "You cannot overwrite this save data because
it belongs to another user. You can resume play
from a mid-battle save point on the main menu.",
  "0.12.0" => "Could not use game data installed on the
