  "4.515.0" => "Posting to Miiverse...",
  "4.516.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.2.0)

Added A6ability to purchase add-on contentR! You can now purchase
AOC for the game from Nintendo eShop. From the game's main menu,
head to "Extras" and then "Add-On Content" to see what's available!
(Already purchased content is available via the Extras menu.)
As an added perk, purchasing the A6Legends of Hyrule PackR will
unlock the new A6Wind Waker RobesR costume for Ganondorf.

Improved game stability",
  "4.517.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.3.0)

Added A6MedliR, a new warrior who can
control the power of wind to bring the fight to
enemies both on the ground and in the air!

Added A6new medalsR waiting to be won!

Improved game stability",
  "4.518.0" => "You've unlocked a new costume for %s:
A6%sR!",
  "4.519.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.2.1)

As an added perk, purchasing the
A6Hero of Hyrule PackR will unlock
the new A6Dark LinkR costume for Link.",
  "4.520.0" => "Proceed to Nintendo eShop?",
  "4.521.0" => "A6Cia's TaleR has been added to
Legend Mode.",
  "4.522.0" => "The A6Master Quest mapR has been
added to Adventure Mode!",
  "4.523.0" => "Update Content (Ver.1.3.0)

Added playable warriors: A6CiaR, A6VolgaR, and
A6WizzroR.
Added A6Midbattle Cinematics On/Off functionR.
This option lets you select whether cinematics
will play during Adventure Mode battles. Toggle
them on or off in Game Settings, found in the
Settings menu.
As a bonus when purchasing the A6Hero of Hyrule PackR, the Dark Link
costume for Link will be unlocked.
Other corrections",
  "4.524.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.2.0)

Added the option to A6clear all save dataR!
This lets you easily delete all save data for this game from
your system. To do so, hold down P0, P1, P2 and P3 after launching
the game from the HOME Menu. Please be careful, however,
as the data cannot be restored once it has been deleted.",
  "4.525.0" => "The A6Twilight mapR has been
added to Adventure Mode!",
  "4.526.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.4.0)

Raised A6maximum warrior levelR to 150 and added A6new medalsR!

Introduced A6new fairy companionR, waiting to lend you her strength
and join you on your adventure! (Please note that if you
part ways with this fairy you may not be able to meet her again.)

Improved game stability",
