  "4.580.0" => "A6The Tale of the Girl in the Green TunicR
has been added to Legend Mode!",
  "4.581.0" => "The A6Saga of the Great SeaR has been
added to Legend Mode!",
  "4.582.0" => "A6%sR Damage Up",
  "4.583.0" => "A6%sR Cost Down",
  "4.584.0" => "You received something via SpotPass!
A6%sR",
  "4.585.0" => "Do you want to part ways
with %s?",
  "4.586.0" => "You cannot keep any more companion fairies.
Please choose some to part ways with.
You can only keep a maximum of %s.",
  "4.587.0" => "You got A6%sR!",
  "4.588.0" => "You got A6%1sR x%2s!
",
  "4.589.0" => "A fairy reward appeared!",
  "4.590.0" => "Set "A6%sR" as
the Rental Skill you will use?",
  "4.591.0" => "If you activate StreetPass, StreetPass Links
will appear on Adventure Mode maps.
Activate StreetPass now?",
  "4.592.0" => "StreetPass is now activated.
It will run automatically, even if you
close this game.",
  "4.593.0" => "If you deactivate StreetPass, StreetPass Links 
will no longer appear on Adventure Mode maps.
Deactivate StreetPass now?",
  "4.594.0" => "Receive notifications and data about the game
(may include advertising and promotions)?",
  "4.595.0" => "Stop receiving notifications and data about the
game, including advertising and promotions?",
  "4.596.0" => "You may choose to share information
about your gameplay with Nintendo
in order to help us develop future
products and services.
Would you like to share your gameplay
information with Nintendo?",
  "4.597.0" => "Maximum number of companion fairies has
increased! You can now keep up to %s.",
  "4.598.0" => "Seal broken by finding all plus-grade weapons.",
  "4.599.0" => "You caught a A6companion fairyR!",
  "4.600.0" => "You received a parting gift!
A6%sR",
  "4.601.0" => "You received something via SpotPass!
A6%1sR ×%2s",
  "4.602.0" => "You received A6%sR!",
  "4.603.0" => "Return to the previous screen?
(Changes you have made will be saved
when you leave the Settings menu.)",
  "4.604.0" => "You got rid of the sea hazard!",
  "4.605.0" => "The headwind disappeared!",
  "4.606.0" => "You have already purchased this
add-on content.",
  "4.607.0" => "You must have the latest version of the
software in order to purchase this add-on
content. Please download the latest update
data from Nintendo eShop, then try again.",
  "4.608.0" => "You have already downloaded this
add-on content.",
  "4.609.0" => "End connection and exit?",
  "4.610.0" => "You cannot download this add-on content
since you have not purchased it yet.",
  "4.611.0" => "Would you like to clear all save data?",
  "4.612.0" => "Are you sure you want to continue?
Cleared save data cannot be restored.
Please note that the process will begin
as soon as you select "Yes".",
  "4.613.0" => "A character download code has been issued for
you to use in Hyrule Warriors (Wii U). You can
find the code in your Account Activity in
Nintendo eShop.",
  "4.614.0" => "You have already purchased this content.
You can find your character download code for
Hyrule Warriors (Wii U) in your Account Activity
in Nintendo eShop.",
  "4.615.0" => "This add-on content A6includes some content that
you have already purchasedR. You can still
purchase it, but you will be charged for all of
it. No cancellation or refund is possible.",
  "4.616.0" => "This add-on content includes some content
that you you have already purchased, so you
cannot purchase it.",
  "4.617.0" => "This add-on content A6cannot be used in
Hyrule Warriors (Wii U)R. To use the same
content in Hyrule Warriors (Wii U), you will need
to purchase the version of this add-on content
labeled "(Nintendo 3DS + Wii U)".",
  "4.618.0" => "Please note that you can purchase A6either
the "(Nintendo 3DS + Wii U)"R or the
A6"(Nintendo 3DS)"R version of any given
piece of add-on content, A6but not bothR.",
  "4.619.0" => "This add-on content A6includes a character
download code for Hyrule Warriors (Wii U)R.
If you only want to use the add-on content in
Hyrule Warriors Legends (Nintendo 3DS), 
you can purchase the version of this add-on
content labeled "(Nintendo 3DS)".",
  "4.620.0" => "Please note that you can only purchase add-on
content labeled "(Nintendo 3DS + Wii U)" or
"(Nintendo 3DS)".",
  "4.621.0" => "This add-on content includes some content
that you have already purchased, so you
cannot download it.",
  "4.622.0" => "Purchasing add-on content is not available
in your country.",
  "4.623.0" => "The A6Master Wind Waker MapR
has been added to Adventure Mode!",
  "4.624.0" => "The egg counter has increased by one!",
  "4.625.0" => "The Nightmare has been dispelled from this map
square so the enemies are no longer hidden!",
  "4.626.0" => "A A6Siren PowerR is affecting
all of Koholint Island!",
  "4.627.0" => "The Nightmare has been dispelled from this map
square so the enemies are no longer hidden!
Also, a A6Siren PowerR is affecting
all of Koholint Island!",
  "4.628.0" => "The Wind Fish has awoken and its power has
completely driven away all Nightmares!",
  "4.629.0" => "Enemies have appeared on a new map square!",
  "4.630.0" => "The power of the Instruments of the Sirens
has been unleashed!",
  "4.631.0" => "A A6Siren PowerR is already in effect.
You can chase away the Nightmare, but
a new A6Siren PowerR will not occur.
Is this okay?",
  "4.632.0" => "It's Grandpa Ulrira! You unlocked a victory reward!",
  "4.633.0" => "C2About update dataR

An update for the game has been downloaded.
C2Please do not delete the update dataR,
as doing so may lead to loss of game stability.",
  "4.634.0" => "This add-on content cannot be used in
A6Hyrule Warriors (Wii U)R.",
  "4.635.0" => "The A6Siren PowerR has worn off.",
  "4.636.0" => "The Nightmare looms once more somewhere
on the map. Awaken the Wind Fish to dispel it
for good!",
  "4.637.0" => "No trace of the enemy... It seems your
instrument isn't powerful enough.",
  "4.638.0" => "A6Koholint Island MapR was added
to Adventure Mode.",
  "4.639.0" => "The A6Grand Travels MapR
was added to Adventure Mode!",
  "4.640.0" => "A6NerisR is now your fairy companion!
(Please note that if you part ways with Neris,
you may not be able to meet her again.)",
  "4.641.0" => "A6Captain PowerR is affecting the entire
Grand Travels Map!",
  "4.642.0" => "A6Engine PowerR is affecting the entire
Grand Travels Map!",
  "4.643.0" => "You can receive a card of your choosing.
Do you want to receive a card?",
  "4.644.0" => "We have a deal!
I'll trade you some food for that Item Card!",
  "4.645.0" => "Ee-yeah!
Come again, okay?",
  "4.646.0" => "Linebeck Trading Company Sale Coming Soon!
A A6Two-For-One SaleR will start in three battles!",
  "4.647.0" => "A A6Song StoneR has reappeared
somewhere on the map!",
  "4.648.0" => "The A6Linebeck Trading CompanyR has
opened up shop somewhere on the map!",
  "4.649.0" => "Some sand has fallen through
the A6Phantom HourglassR!",
  "4.650.0" => "The sand in the A6Phantom HourglassR
has returned to the top!",
  "4.651.0" => "All of the sand in the A6Phantom HourglassR
has fallen! Moving to the next map square will
now be more difficult.",
  "4.652.0" => "You defeated all the A6Boss Giant BeastsR!
The curse cast on the Grand Travels Map has
been lifted. You can move to new maps squares!",
  "4.653.0" => "A6Captain PowerR has disappeared
from the entire map.",
  "4.654.0" => "A6Engine PowerR has disappeared
from the entire map.",
  "4.655.0" => "Message from the Linebeck Trading Company:

The A6Two-For-One SaleR started!",
  "4.656.0" => "You defeated one of the A6Boss Giant
BeastsR responsible for the curse! Defeat
the one remaining Boss Giant Beast to lift the
curse from the Grand Travels Map!",
  "4.657.0" => "A6BeckaR is now your fairy companion!
(Please note that if you part ways with Becka,
you may not be able to meet her again.)",
  "4.658.0" => "You already have five of that Item Card.
You cannot carry any more.",
  "4.659.0" => "Huh? You don't know about A6FoodR?
Well, come back after you've gotten some
Food and then we'll do business!",
  "4.660.0" => "All of the sand in the A6Phantom HourglassR
has fallen! Once the current Engine Power
fades, moving to the next map square will be
more difficult.",
  "4.661.0" => "You got A6%1sR x%2s!",
  "4.662.0" => "The A6Lorule MapR
was added to Adventure Mode.",
  "4.663.0" => "A A6Nice PowerR is affecting
the entire Lorule Map!",
  "4.664.0" => "A A6Nice PowerR with the same effect
is already active. You can use this item card to
search here, but a new A6Nice PowerR will not
occur. Is this okay?",
  "4.665.0" => "Two kinds of A6Nice PowerR are already
active. If a new power comes into effect,
the current ones will disappear. Is this okay?",
  "4.666.0" => "You are being warped to another world!",
  "4.667.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.5.0) (page 2 of 2)

(continued from page 1)

Introduced A6new Rental SkillsR to let your
fairy companions grow even stronger!

Improved game stability.",
  "4.668.0" => "You can now use the A6fissureR on this map square!",
  "4.669.0" => "Update notes (Ver. 1.6.0) (page 2 of 2)

(continued from page 1)

You can now find weapons with a A6new skillR!
"Heart Power" increases a warrior's attack damage according to
their maximum hearts. Make your favourite weapons ever better!
You may now find A6more food at onceR!
Improved game stability.",
  "4.670.0" => "No more Health skills can be added.",
  "4.671.0" => "We thank you for the help, my tykes and I!
I've opened up a nice A6battle rewardR for you,
by and by!",
  "4.711.0" => "Special Attacks",
