  "5.4700.0" => "A sword-and-shield combo modified for use by
left-handed warriors. Charge energy by holding
down the A6Strong Attack buttonR, and then
release for a powerful Spin Attack!",
  "5.4701.0" => "A magical rod that summons fire. It attacks
over a wide area, so it's perfect for bringing
the heat on large groups of enemies.",
  "5.4702.0" => "A Great Fairy has decided to help you...in her
own way. Behold her unique Combo Attacks, or
use a A6Strong AttackR to increase your
attack strength...at the cost of some defense.",
  "5.4703.0" => "A power-gauntlet-and-flail-combo set, perfect for
devastating attacks. Pressing the A6Strong AttackR
A6buttonR allows you to pick up and throw enemies.",
  "5.4704.0" => "A magical tome held by a guardian of dimensions.
Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to leap
ahead. Leaping from magic walls you created
detonates them, damaging any nearby foes.",
  "5.4705.0" => "A branch from the Great Deku Tree, imbued with
its power. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to plant
Deku Tree saplings, which will quickly sprout and
knock back enemies.",
  "5.4706.0" => "A magical tool created by sorceresses of old.
Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to summon a
monster, and then do a Combo Attack with the
same monster for an extra-powerful strike!",
  "5.4707.0" => "A sword forged with magical light, making it light
as a feather. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to
gather the power of light, and strike with more
devastating strength when using a Combo Attack!",
  "5.4708.0" => "A legendary baton that can control the very wind.
Create whirlwinds to bind your enemies, then hit
the bound foes with the A6Strong AttackR tornado
to increase its destructive power!",
  "5.4709.0" => "A sword created by the finest Goron smithy who
ever lived. It slices deep but requires immense
strength to wield. Press the A6Strong AttackR
A6buttonR to quickly dash into enemies!",
  "5.4710.0" => "A naginata enchanted with fire, handed down in
the Sheikah tribe for generations. Use the A6StrongR
A6Attack buttonR to create a wall of flame in front of
you that can halt an enemy in its tracks!",
  "5.4711.0" => "A set of great swords brimming with dark power.
Hold Pc at the end of a Combo Attack to fill
your gauge, then press Pc to unleash the
collected energy in a powerful attack.",
  "5.4712.0" => "A harp that commands magical melodies. It can
be imbued with elemental affinity using Combo
Attacks. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to tap into
elemental powers and cause various effects.",
  "5.4713.0" => "A special hammer for Darunia's use only. Use the
A6Strong Attack buttonR to charge at enemies. Hit
an enemy to lock on to that enemy, allowing
you to follow up with more Strong Attacks!",
  "5.4714.0" => "An amulet of the Zora people, imbued with the
power of water. Each Combo Attack fills a water
gauge. Press the A6Strong Attack buttonR to
expend the water for a powerful distance attack!",
  "5.4715.0" => "The beloved parasol of the insect kingdom's
(self-proclaimed) princess. The basket is filled to
bursting with insects. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR
to fight from the back of an enormous butterfly!",
  "5.4716.0" => "A cursed shackle, originating from the Twilight
Realm. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to grab and
hurl an enemy with your hair. You'll also be
temporarily imbued with the power of darkness.",
  "5.4717.0" => "A sword created by the goddess in the distant
past. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to
temporarily imbue yourself with the power of light.",
  "5.4718.0" => "A sword created by the demon tribe in the
distant past. Press the A6Strong Attack
buttonR to lock on to a foe. Attack again
to shower it with a barrage of dark energy!",
  "5.4719.0" => "Curved blades birthed from Twilight magic.
A gauge fills up with each Combo Attack you
connect. Use the A6Strong Attack buttonR to expend
the gauge and bombard your foes with energy.",
  "5.4720.0" => "The legendary blade of evil's bane. Only the
chosen hero can wield this sword. When
attacking with full health, your strikes gain
a little extra oomph!",
  "5.4721.0" => "A scepter topped with magic crystals that enable it
to be used like a whip. Use the A6Strong Attack
buttonR to temporarily add the darkness element 
to attacks and make you immune to knock-back.",
  "5.4722.0" => "An exquisite spear, carved from the bones of a
dragon, it channels a fraction of the great beast's
might. Use a A6Strong AttackR or a Combo Attack
after evading to break the enemy's guard.",
  "5.4723.0" => "A cursed ring whose dark powers have been
amplified by absorbing the essence of its owners
through the ages. It condenses the souls of the
deceased into a single, monstrous spirit.",
  "5.4724.0" => "Link's beloved steed and most faithful companion.
When the gauge is full, charge ahead with a
A6Strong AttackR. You can also charge by
holding Pc at the end of a Combo Attack.",
  "5.4725.0" => "A sacred treasure that amplifies Twilight magic and
can summon objects from the Twilight Realm. Its
powerful A6Strong AttackR takes a long time to cast,
though filling up the Twilight gauge speeds it up.",
  "5.4726.0" => "An ancient machine designed to float over land.
Use a A6Strong AttackR to deploy the Spinner,
and then follow up with various types of combos
to turn your enemies' worlds upside down!",
  "5.4727.0" => "A mysterious rod with the ability to command stone
statues. Use a A6Strong AttackR to control a statue,
and then lead it to battle with Combo Attacks.",
  "5.4728.0" => "A mysterious mask containing the spirit of a fierce
deity. Whoever wears the mask gains that spirit's
power. Using a A6Strong AttackR with the Ocarina of
Time converts the SP gauge to your Magic gauge.",
  "5.4729.0" => "A giant balloon, made for floating through the sky.
Use a A6Strong AttackR to trigger the quick escape
function, allowing you to dodge attacks or dish
out further Regular or Combo Attacks.",
  "5.4730.0" => "Ganon's Rage",
  "5.4731.0" => "Cucco's Spirit",
  "5.4732.0" => "A trident that holds the terrifying power
of lightning. Use a A6Strong AttackR to
throw the trident in front of you, and then
chase down your prey to move and attack.",
  "5.4733.0" => "Two crossbows normally used to protect
Cuccos from Wolfos. Use the A6Strong AttackR to
fire continuously, or hold down Pc after a 
Combo Attack to fire bomb arrows!",
  "5.4734.0" => "An ocarina that the Skull Kid stole. When used, it
gives orders to Tatl and Tael to attack. A A6StrongR
A6AttackR summons a vicious marionette to appear and
attack your foes!",
  "5.4735.0" => "A light sword meant for younger adventurers. Use
a A6Strong AttackR to jump away from attacks, and
then follow through with a midair strike!",
  "5.4736.0" => "A cutlass and pistol combo. Attack nearby enemies
with quick slashes from the cutlass. Then pick off
faraway targets with the pistol. Use a A6StrongR
A6AttackR to fire bullets that break down defenses!",
  "5.4737.0" => "A sail used by the King of Red Lions. It holds the
awesome power of the wind and the fury of the
Great Sea. Use a A6Strong AttackR to summon the
wind's blessings to increase your attack speed.",
  "5.4738.0" => "A harp imbued with holy power. Strum it while
praying to attack with wind magic. Gather the
power of wind with a A6Strong AttackR to use
an evasive attack by pressing Pd while airborne.",
  "5.4739.0" => "A bell used to awaken the Wind Fish. When rung,
the magic clapper inside unleashes powerful
attacks. A A6Strong AttackR will expend its stored
power, dealing damage equal to the amount used.",
  "5.4740.0" => "These winged boots harness the power of lightning
and the fury of Cuccos to unleash powerful kicks.
Use a A6Strong AttackR to barrel through foes,
with an extra attack if you hit a powerful enemy!",
  "5.4741.0" => "A huge sword and shield wielded by guardians of
the Tower of Spirits. A A6Strong AttackR
transforms the wielder into an iron ball that
pushes back enemies who get in the way.",
  "5.4742.0" => "When waved, this rod summons not only solid sand
blocks but also a steam engine! Press the A6Strong
AttackR button repeatedly to hop aboard and go
for a ride. The fuller the gauge, the longer the ride!",
  "5.4743.0" => "This massive hammer and a myriad of items will
unleash fierce explosions and cyclones upon your
enemies. A A6Strong AttackR will summon ice.
Hold down Pc to boost your attack range!",
  "5.4744.0" => "A A6Strong AttackR will hide your image within
this picture frame as you charge forward. Hold
Pc after attacking to bind your foe with a
magic circle, opening them up to follow-up attacks!",
