  "5.9423.0" => "You got some bombs!
Toss them at enemies for a devastating effect.
They're also great for blowing up boulders!",
  "5.9424.0" => "You got a bow and arrows!
Use arrows to hit faraway enemies.
Arrows pierce through small enemies!",
  "5.9425.0" => "You got a boomerang!
It stops enemies in their tracks, plus it comes
back when you throw it, just like it should!",
  "5.9426.0" => "You got a Hookshot!
Use it to latch on to enemies and ledges.
Great for increased battlefield mobility!",
  "5.9427.0" => "You got a Weapon Pouch!
You'll have to wait and see what's
inside when you check it out later!",
  "5.9428.0" => "You got a sealed weapon!
It might be a completely new weapon,
but you'll have to check it later!",
  "5.9429.0" => "You got some Rupees!
You're beaming!",
  "5.9430.0" => "You got a Heart Container!
Your maximum hearts have increased by one!",
  "5.9431.0" => "You got a Piece of Heart!
Collect four pieces to increase
your maximum hearts by one!",
  "5.9432.0" => "You got a Gold Rupee!
You're ecstatic!",
  "5.9433.0" => "You got a Boss Key!
Get ready for the final battle!",
  "5.9434.0" => "You got a standard material!
It can be used to make a new badge!",
  "5.9435.0" => "You got a rare material!
You might be able to make a
really nice badge with it!",
  "5.9436.0" => "You got a super rare material!
You can use it to make a
really special badge!",
  "5.9437.0" => "You got a Piece of Heart!
Your maximum hearts have increased by one!
Collect four more to increase it again!",
  "5.9438.0" => "You got a new costume!
Be sure to check it out later!",
  "5.9439.0" => "You got the Hammer!
Slam enemies to topple them!
Also handy for pressing big switches!",
  "5.9440.0" => "You got an ocarina!
Now you can warp to any
activated Owl Statues!",
  "5.9441.0" => "You got some food!
Try feeding it to your companion fairies!",
  "5.9442.0" => "You got some tasty food!
Your fairies are sure to love it!",
  "5.9443.0" => "You got some delicious food!
It might help your fairies grow
in leaps and bounds!",
  "5.9444.0" => "You got some fairy clothing!
Look forward to checking it out later!",
